  },
  {
   "id": "C.1.18-s004",
   "section": "C.1.18",
   "kind": "prose",
   "context": null,
   "normative": true,
   "text": "For the purpose of this conversion, a hexstring shall be converted into a bitstring, where the hex digits of the",
   "lines": [
    25113,
    25113
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "C.1.18-s005",
   "section": "C.1.18",
   "kind": "code",
   "context": null,
   "normative": true,
   "text": "hexstring are converted in groups of bits as follows:",
   "lines": [
    25114,
    25116
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "C.1.18-s006",
   "section": "C.1.18",
   "kind": "prose",
   "context": null,
   "normative": true,
   "text": "'0'H → '0000'B, '1'H → '0001'B, '2'H → '0010'B, '3'H → '0011'B, '4'H → '0100'B, '5'H → '0101'B,",
   "lines": [
    25118,
    25118
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "C.1.18-s007",
   "section": "C.1.18",
   "kind": "prose",
   "context": null,
   "normative": true,
   "text": "'6'H → '0110'B, '7'H → '0111'B, '8'H → '1000'B, '9'H → '1001'B, 'A'H → '1010'B, 'B'H → '1011'B,",
   "lines": [
    25120,
    25120
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "C.1.18-s008",
   "section": "C.1.18",
   "kind": "prose",
   "context": null,
   "normative": true,
   "text": "'C'H → '1100'B, 'D'H → '1101'B, 'E'H → '1110'B, and 'F'H → '1111'B.",
   "lines": [
    25122,
    25122
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "C.1.18-s009",
   "section": "C.1.18",
   "kind": "prose",
   "context": null,
   "normative": true,
   "text": "The consecutive order of the groups of 4 bits in the resulting bitstring is the same as the order of hex digits in the hexstring.",
   "lines": [
    25124,
    25125
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "C.1.18-s010",
   "section": "C.1.18",
   "kind": "prose",
   "context": null,
   "normative": true,
   "text": "The general error causes in clause 16.1.2 apply.",
   "lines": [
    25127,
    25127
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "C.1.18-s011",
   "section": "C.1.18",
   "kind": "example-text",
   "context": null,
   "normative": false,
   "text": "EXAMPLE:",
   "lines": [
